  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1510576.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(16 fotos) El restaurant La Alacena ha abierto sus puertas este jueves al p&uacute;blico en general en la calle Isidoro Peris, 18 de Onda, despu&eacute;s de que la noche del mi&eacute;rcoles se inaugurara para familiares y amistades. En un local acogedor, ofrece men&uacute; diario exquisito realizado en la cocina y en barbacoa, adem&aacute;s de tapas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciorestaurantlaalacena/p1510566.jpg\" alt=\"p1510566\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciorestaurantlaalacena/p1510568.jpg\" alt=\"p1510568\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciorestaurantlaalacena/p1510570.jpg\" alt=\"p1510570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciorestaurantlaalacena/p1510571.jpg\" alt=\"p1510571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciorestaurantlaalacena/p1510572.jpg\" alt=\"p1510572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciorestaurantlaalacena/p1510573.jpg\" alt=\"p1510573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciorestaurantlaalacena/p1510574.jpg\" alt=\"p1510574\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciorestaurantlaalacena/p1510576.jpg\" alt=\"p1510576\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/